-- S 115/2001 (the Notification as made, first published 2 March 2001 at 5:00 pm, in operation 2 March 2001; deposited 2026-11-04 from the e-Gazette's second list):
-- paragraph 2(b) reads "the in-building or localised on-site installation or operation of the equipment specified in the Schedule" and the Schedule has 15 items, headed
-- "EXEMPTION IN RESPECT OF IN-BUILDING OR LOCALISED ON-SITE OPERATION OF EQUIPMENT", with limits printed in "dB" and "mW" (the later texts print "dBµV/m").  S 525/2001 deletes
-- "in-building or" from paragraph 2(b) and substitutes a Schedule that adds item 16, Short Range Radar System, and changes the bands of items 3, 7, 12 and 13 among others.
-- Paragraph 2(a) names the Telecommunications (Radio-communication) Regulations 2001 (G.N. No. S 114/2001), the Rg 5 as made, which is NOT deposited.  Item 11(e) is "TV Receivers and
-- Radio Systems" here and "TV Receivers/ Radio Systems" in the later texts; the entry is the same equipment.  The footnote "**" ("For in-building operations only") attaches to two bands of item 13.
-- src:TA1999-N1-S115-2001:30 | 1. This Notification may be cited as the Telecommunications
