-- src:TA1999-N1-S115-2001:172 | meet the output power limits specified for the same type of equipment are exempted from licensing
-- src:TA1999-N1-S115-2001:173 | as long as both the output power limits and the radio frequency bands are approved by the Authority.
-- src:TA1999-N1-S115-2001:174 | ** For in-building operations only.
@ref N 1 as made, S 115/2001 (src:TA1999-N1-S115-2001:30-174)
GIVEN `has been permitted by the Authority to use a radio frequency band under regulation 75 of Rg 5` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the installation or operation is in-building` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the installation or operation is localised and on-site` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the equipment is one of those the Schedule specifies` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`N 1 para 2 (as made, 2 March 2001 to 16 October 2001): sections 33, 34(1)(b) and 35 do not apply` MEANS
        `has been permitted by the Authority to use a radio frequency band under regulation 75 of Rg 5`
    OR ((`the installation or operation is in-building` OR `the installation or operation is localised and on-site`) AND `the equipment is one of those the Schedule specifies`)

GIVETH A LIST OF `N 1 schedule item`
`N 1 Schedule items, as made (2 March 2001 to 16 October 2001)` MEANS
