-- S 78/2017 (in operation 1 April 2017, first published 1 March 2017) inserts item 18, Intelligent Transport System, after item 17 of the First Schedule.
-- The item is vehicle-to-roadside radio (a vehicular on-board unit and roadside infrastructure on 5.9 GHz); it is not a receiver of broadcasts and does not
