-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- S 588/2023 (Telecommunications (Exemption from sections 33, 34(1)(b) and 35) (Amendment) Notification 2023; deposited 2026-11-04 from the e-Gazette's follow-up list): made 22 Aug 2023
-- under s 96, FIRST PUBLISHED 28 Aug 2023 at 5 pm, in operation 1 Sep 2023 "except for paragraphs 2 and 3(a)", which are "deemed to have come into operation on 31 December 2021" (para 1(2)).
-- Paragraphs 2 and 3(a) only change the section numbers the Notification names, to "sections 53, 54(1)(b) and 55" (the numbers of the 2020 Revised Edition, in operation 31 Dec 2021);
-- paragraph 3(b) deletes "localised on-site" from sub-paragraph (b) of paragraph 2; paragraph 3(c) updates two web addresses; paragraph 4 replaces First Schedule items 2, 3, 5 and 8 to 15 and
-- the heading's "LOCALISED ON-SITE"; paragraph 5 replaces Second Schedule items 1 to 3.  The text layer of the Gazette PDF puts a space inside some words ("exerc ise", "Notific ation"); the
-- quotation below keeps the text as extracted.
-- Item 14 is now "Global Navigation Satellite Systems Receivers" (the "Stand-alone GPS Receivers" of item 14 until 31 Aug 2023) and item 13 now "Wireless LAN, RFID or Low Power Devices"; item 11(e)
-- is still "TV Receivers/ Radio Systems" under "Remote Control Devices".  No item names a broadcast receiver.
-- The seat reads only whether item 11(e) is named, and it is named in this vintage as before.
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:14 | In exerc ise of the powers c onferred by sec tion 96 of the
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:15 | Telec ommunic ations Ac t 1999, the Minister for Communications
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:16 | and Information makes the following Notification:
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:18 | Citation and commencement
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:19 | 1.—(1) This Notific ation is the Telec ommunic ations (Exemption
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:20 | from sections 33, 34(1)(b) and 35) (Amendment) Notification 2023
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:21 | and, exc ept for paragraphs 2 and 3(a), c omes into operation on
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:22 | 1 September 2023.
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:23 | (2) Paragraphs 2 and 3(a) are deemed to have come into operation
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:24 | on 31 December 2021.
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:26 | Amendment of paragraph 1
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:27 | 2. In the Telec ommunic ations (Exemption from sec tions 33,
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:28 | 34(1)(b) and 35) Notific ation (N 1) (c alled in this Notific ation the
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:29 | principal Notification), in paragraph 1, replace “sections 33, 34(1)(b)
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:30 | and 35” with “sections 53, 54(1)(b) and 55”.
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:32 | Amendment of paragraph 2
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:33 | 3. In the principal Notification, in paragraph 2 —
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:34 | (a) replace “Sections 33, 34(1)(b) and 35” with “Sections 53,
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:35 | 54(1)(b) and 55”;
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:36 | (b) in sub‑paragraph (b), delete “localised on‑site”; and
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:37 | (c) in sub‑paragraphs (c) and (d), replace
-- src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:38 | “http://www.ida.gov.sg” with “https://www.imda.gov.sg”.
@ref N 1 as amended by S 588/2023, paragraphs 1 to 3 (citation and commencement; amendment of paragraphs 1 and 2) (src:TA1999-N1-S588-2023:14-38)
GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`N 1 paras 1 and 2: the sections of the Act the Notification names, for the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 28 8 2023)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 31 12 2021)) THEN JUST "sections 53, 54(1)(b) and 55"  -- paragraphs 2 and 3(a) of S 588/2023, deemed in operation 31 Dec 2021, first published 28 Aug 2023
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 2 3 2001)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 2 3 2001)) THEN JUST "sections 33, 34(1)(b) and 35"
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

GIVEN `has been permitted by the Authority to use a radio frequency band under regulation 75 of Rg 5` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the equipment is one of those the First Schedule specifies` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the equipment is one of those the Second Schedule specifies` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the installation or operation is in accordance with the technical specifications on white space devices published by the Authority` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`N 1 para 2 (form from 1 September 2023): sections 53, 54(1)(b) and 55 do not apply` MEANS
        `has been permitted by the Authority to use a radio frequency band under regulation 75 of Rg 5`
    OR `the equipment is one of those the First Schedule specifies`
    OR (`the equipment is one of those the Second Schedule specifies` AND `the installation or operation is in accordance with the technical specifications on white space devices published by the Authority`)

