-- The date selects the vintage.
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE (LIST OF `N 1 schedule item`)
`N 1: the items the (First) Schedule names on the date` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 2 3 2001) THEN NOTHING
           IF d LESS THAN (Date 17 10 2001) THEN JUST (`N 1 Schedule items, as made (2 March 2001 to 16 October 2001)`)
           IF d LESS THAN (Date 1 1 2003) THEN JUST (`N 1 Schedule items, 17 October 2001 to 31 December 2002`)
           IF d LESS THAN (Date 2 1 2008) THEN JUST (`N 1 Schedule items, 2002 Revised Edition`)
           IF d LESS THAN (Date 1 11 2014) THEN JUST (`N 1 Schedule items, 2 January 2008 to 31 October 2014`)
           IF d LESS THAN (Date 1 4 2017) THEN JUST (`N 1 First Schedule items, from 1 November 2014`)
           IF d LESS THAN (Date 1 9 2023) THEN JUST (`N 1 First Schedule items, from 1 April 2017`)
           OTHERWISE JUST (`N 1 First Schedule items, from 1 September 2023`)

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`N 1: the date has a Second Schedule` MEANS d AT LEAST (Date 1 11 2014)

-- Does the (First) Schedule name this equipment on the date?  NOTHING when the vintage is not deposited.
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      item IS AN `N 1 schedule item`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`N 1: the (First) Schedule names the equipment on the date` MEANS
    CONSIDER `N 1: the items the (First) Schedule names on the date` d
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST items THEN JUST (elem item items)
